    {
      "gameKey": "custom/001/CmnDefBeautySalon_00148#TEXT_CMNDEFBEAUTYSALON_00148_JANDELAINE_000_010",
      "en": "Where once stood a disheveled shell of a <if(gnum4,woman,man)>, there now shines...a beauty reborn.",
